  at the top of the page and shrinks to the icon inside it once the page
  scrolls (nav.scss, .nav__sticker). Inline, so the lettering takes the nav's
  text colour. The yellow corners are shared by both and drawn in CSS, so they
  keep their size while the sticker shrinks; the SVGs are the logo and the
  icon without them.
#}
